      "telop" : "「なら、私の質問に答えなさい。」",
      "voiceCharacter" : "古明地こいし",
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #43",
      "characterName" : "古明地こいし",
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "backgroundName" : "image60.jpeg",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第21話_5cc8f81983\/元女子校の日常　第21話_5cc8f81983.043.jpeg",
      "voiceDuration" : 3.255238095238095,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0
    },
    {
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "duration" : 8.547369614512471,
      "id" : "76FFB54B-30AA-4302-BED5-F3BE7DE2DFC7",
      "characterImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第21話\/頬照り小口開け.png",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_044_操夢.wav",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第21話\/image60.jpeg",
      "title" : "シーン 44",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "telop" : "彼女はそう言うと、僕に関することをいろいろ聞いてきた。両親のことや、前の学校、そして最後にフランとの関係について。",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #44",
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "backgroundName" : "image60.jpeg",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第21話_5cc8f81983\/元女子校の日常　第21話_5cc8f81983.044.jpeg",
      "voiceDuration" : 8.547369614512471,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0
    },
    {
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "duration" : 10.075668934240364,
      "id" : "C0CFFD2B-A45F-4300-8E9F-DF724DFDB527",
      "characterImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第21話\/頬照り小口開け.png",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_045_古明地こいし.wav",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第21話\/image60.jpeg",
      "title" : "シーン 45",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_%E5%8F%A4%E6%98%8E%E5%9C%B0%E3%81%93%E3%81%84%E3%81%97",
      "telop" : "「あなたのことが、よく分かったわ。とりあえず、向こうに折り返しの電話を、かけなさい。聞きたいことがまだあるから。」",
      "voiceCharacter" : "古明地こいし",
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #45",
      "characterName" : "古明地こいし",
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "backgroundName" : "image60.jpeg",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第21話_5cc8f81983\/元女子校の日常　第21話_5cc8f81983.045.jpeg",
      "voiceDuration" : 10.075668934240364,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0
    },
    {
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "duration" : 8.273469387755101,
      "id" : "096AB06F-7341-4836-907C-DFBFC0D0B34D",
      "characterImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第21話\/頬照り小口開け.png",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_046_操夢.wav",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第21話\/image60.jpeg",
      "title" : "シーン 46",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "telop" : "僕は、彼女にそう言われ、受話器を取ると、フランたちの家電にかけてもらい、その後彼女が、フランたちに長電話をしていた。",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #46",
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "backgroundName" : "image60.jpeg",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第21話_5cc8f81983\/元女子校の日常　第21話_5cc8f81983.046.jpeg",
      "voiceDuration" : 8.273469387755101,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0
    },
    {
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "duration" : 2.5,
      "id" : "B98EFE1F-E790-4C96-8F1B-DC7A992D5DA8",
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "title" : "シーン 47: 一方、さとりとアリスの部屋では…",
      "telop" : "一方、さとりとアリスの部屋では…",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #47",
      "characterName" : "古明地さとり",
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "backgroundName" : "単色背景",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第21話_5cc8f81983\/元女子校の日常　第21話_5cc8f81983.047.jpeg",
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "seVolume" : 1
    },
    {
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "duration" : 6.328185941043084,
      "id" : "EEB1B058-C2D4-4F45-8127-FE06635F6008",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_048_古明地さとり.wav",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第21話\/image65.jpeg",
      "title" : "シーン 48",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_%E5%8F%A4%E6%98%8E%E5%9C%B0%E3%81%95%E3%81%A8%E3%82%8A",
      "telop" : "私は、暇つぶしにテレビを見ていると、ある速報が流れる。\n私は、その速報を見ると、妹の部屋に向かう。",
      "voiceCharacter" : "古明地さとり",
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #48",
      "characterName" : "古明地さとり",
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "backgroundName" : "image65.jpeg",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第21話_5cc8f81983\/元女子校の日常　第21話_5cc8f81983.048.jpeg",
      "voiceDuration" : 6.328185941043084,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0
    },
    {
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "duration" : 10.307732426303854,
      "id" : "57D71C65-494F-4460-BD04-F92523E6ABD3",
      "characterImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/困った笑み.png",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_049_古明地こいし.wav",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第21話\/image60.jpeg",
      "title" : "シーン 49",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_%E5%8F%A4%E6%98%8E%E5%9C%B0%E3%81%93%E3%81%84%E3%81%97",
      "telop" : "私が、長電話を終えて、はぁーとため息をついていると、姉が私たちの部屋に入ってくる。「もう情報が出回ってるの？」",
      "voiceCharacter" : "古明地こいし",
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #49",
      "characterName" : "古明地こいし",
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "backgroundName" : "image60.jpeg",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第21話_5cc8f81983\/元女子校の日常　第21話_5cc8f81983.049.jpeg",
      "voiceDuration" : 10.307732426303854,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0
    },
    {
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "duration" : 3.078185941043084,
      "id" : "298A068C-4AF2-4DA8-9CF6-0DA18A20222C",
      "characterImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/困った笑み.png",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_050_古明地さとり.wav",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第21話\/image60.jpeg",
      "title" : "シーン 50",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_%E5%8F%A4%E6%98%8E%E5%9C%B0%E3%81%95%E3%81%A8%E3%82%8A",
      "telop" : "「ねぇ、こいし。テレビで流れている内容は本当なの？」",
      "voiceCharacter" : "古明地さとり",
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #50",
      "characterName" : "古明地さとり",
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "backgroundName" : "image60.jpeg",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第21話_5cc8f81983\/元女子校の日常　第21話_5cc8f81983.050.jpeg",
      "voiceDuration" : 3.078185941043084,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0
    },
    {
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "duration" : 10.43342403628118,
      "id" : "E15D1696-C298-4FD3-96D4-F871EB040573",
      "characterImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/困った笑み.png",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_051_古明地こいし.wav",
